Install:  powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File install.ps1 -Version {{version}}
Manual:   unzip to %LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\{{name}} and run "{{slug}}.exe install".

This build is not code-signed yet, so Windows SmartScreen may say "Windows
protected your PC" when you run websign.exe from a browser download. Click
"More info", then "Run anyway". install.ps1 avoids the prompt.

Verify downloads against SHA256SUMS. Licenses are in the licenses folder.
